  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "rulesetId": "wits_wagers_platform_v1",
  "approvalStatus": "core-user-baseline; 2026-09-22 判定规则二次修订（绝对差值最近 + 仅保留 lower 边缘槽 + 超时不补答）",
  "notes": [
    "Board guess order identifies players p1,p2,... in seat order.",
    "Settlement cases are isolated player ledgers; round cases cross-check board, authors and score together.",
    "Bets must contain A then B. winner odds is net profit, not returned principal.",
    "2026-09-22 二次修订：胜者为与正确答案绝对差值最小的槽位，同距离时两侧并列获胜；答案低于全部猜测则 lower 胜（赔率恒为 6）；答案高于全部猜测时没有特殊槽，由最大的猜测获胜。原「更高」边缘槽已删除，回归原版桌游只有一张「比所有答案都小」卡的设定。",
    "2026-09-22 修订：超时未作答者本轮不上版图，不可能成为作者，也不占槽位。",
    "R02 and ranking tie policy require G0 approval; never treat this fixture as user approval."
  ],
